===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|es|Panamá}}, of {{unk|en|nocap=1}} origin. Possibly from a {{der|en|cba|-}} language such as {{der|en|cuk|-}}, or another [[w:Indigenous languages of the Americas|indigenous language]] of the region (such as [[w:Cueva language|Cueva]], which is barely attested and is now extinct).

{{etystub|en}}

